    {
      "id": 8,
      "start": 12.48,
      "end": 13.48,
      "en": "We've got a great lesson for everyone.",
      "zh": "我们为每个人提供了一个很好的教训。"
    },
    {
      "id": 9,
      "start": 13.48,
      "end": 17.12,
      "en": "Yes, we have a really common situation where we're going to use real English, right?",
      "zh": "是的，我们有一个非常常见的情况，我们将使用真正的英语，对吧？"
    },
    {
      "id": 10,
      "start": 17.52,
      "end": 20.58,
      "en": "Yep, everyday English, English that people really use.",
      "zh": "是的，人们真正使用的日常英语、英语。"
    },
    {
      "id": 11,
      "start": 21.04,
      "end": 22.12,
      "en": "And that's what we want you to learn.",
      "zh": "这就是我们希望您学习的内容。"
