      "end": 595.13,
      "en": "So when that happens to me, when I'm in a business setting, sometimes what I do is I ask for someone's card.",
      "zh": "因此，当这种情况发生在我身上时，当我在商业环境中时，有时我会要求某人的卡片。"
    },
    {
      "id": 226,
      "start": 596.29,
      "end": 597.29,
      "en": "Yeah, that's the good technique.",
      "zh": "是的，这就是好技术。"
    },
    {
      "id": 227,
      "start": 597.52,
      "end": 598.52,
      "en": "Yeah.",
      "zh": "对。"
    },
    {
      "id": 228,
      "start": 598.52,
      "end": 603.91,
      "en": "Or sometimes I might ask them to write down their email because usually their full name is spelled in their email address.",
      "zh": "或者有时我可能会要求他们写下他们的电子邮件，因为他们的全名通常拼写在他们的电子邮件地址中。"
    },
    {
      "id": 229,
      "start": 604.16,
      "end": 605.99,
      "en": "So that's my trick when I've forgotten someone's name.",
      "zh": "所以当我忘记某人的名字时，这就是我的把戏。"
    },
    {
      "id": 230,
      "start": 606.76,
      "end": 607.23,
      "en": "That's a good trick.",
      "zh": "这是一个很好的技巧。"
    },
    {
      "id": 231,
      "start": 607.76,
      "end": 610.99,
      "en": "And I guess a lot of our listeners can take your advice on that.",
      "zh": "我想我们的很多听众都可以接受你的建议。"
    },
    {
      "id": 232,
      "start": 611.48,
      "end": 611.75,
      "en": "Okay.",
      "zh": "好的。"
    },
    {
      "id": 233,
      "start": 612.48,
      "end": 618.13,
      "en": "So I think it's time for us to listen to our dialogue one more time, this time at natural speed.",
      "zh": "所以我认为是时候让我们以自然的速度再听一次我们的对话了。"
    },
    {
      "id": 234,
      "start": 625.86,
      "end": 627.4,
      "en": "Nick, how's it going?",
      "zh": "Nick，最近怎么样？"
    },
    {
      "id": 235,
      "start": 627.96,
      "end": 629.06,
      "en": "Oh, hey.",
      "zh": "哦，嗨。"
    },
    {
      "id": 236,
      "start": 629.92,
      "end": 631.44,
      "en": "What are you doing in this neighborhood?",
      "zh": "你怎么会来这附近？"
    },
    {
      "id": 237,
      "start": 631.96,
      "end": 632.72,
      "en": "Do you live around here?",
      "zh": "你住在这里吗？"
    },
    {
      "id": 238,
      "start": 633.26,
      "end": 635.18,
      "en": "Actually, my office is right around the corner.",
      "zh": "实际上，我的办公室就在拐角处。"
    },
    {
      "id": 239,
      "start": 635.84,
      "end": 638.06,
      "en": "It was great to meet you last week at the conference.",
      "zh": "很高兴上周在会议上见到你。"
    },
    {
      "id": 240,
      "start": 638.52,
      "end": 640.96,
      "en": "I really enjoyed our conversation about foreign investment.",
      "zh": "我真的很喜欢我们关于外国投资的谈话。"
    },
    {
      "id": 241,
      "start": 641.18,
      "end": 642.52,
      "en": "Yeah, yeah.",
      "zh": "对，对。"
    },
    {
      "id": 242,
      "start": 642.64,
      "end": 643.7,
      "en": "It was really interesting.",
      "zh": "真的很有意思。"
    },
    {
      "id": 243,
      "start": 644.54,
      "end": 646.72,
      "en": "You know, I'm in a bit of a hurry, but here's my card.",
      "zh": "我有点赶时间，不过这是我的名片。"
    },
    {
      "id": 244,
      "start": 647.28,
      "end": 649.28,
      "en": "We should definitely meet up again and continue our discussion.",
      "zh": "我们一定要再约时间接着聊。"
    },
    {
      "id": 245,
      "start": 650.08,
      "end": 650.52,
      "en": "Sure.",
      "zh": "当然。"
    },
    {
      "id": 246,
      "start": 650.66,
      "end": 652.52,
      "en": "You still have my contact details, right?",
      "zh": "你还有我的联系方式，对吧？"
    },
    {
      "id": 247,
      "start": 653.2,
      "end": 654.52,
      "en": "You know what?",
      "zh": "你知道吗？"
    },
    {
      "id": 248,
      "start": 654.86,
      "end": 658.26,
      "en": "This is really embarrassing, but your name has just slipped my mind.",
      "zh": "说来真尴尬，我一时想不起你的名字了。"
    },
    {
      "id": 249,
      "start": 658.62,
      "end": 659.26,
      "en": "Can you remind me?",
      "zh": "你能提醒我一下吗？"
    },
    {
      "id": 250,
      "start": 659.94,
      "end": 660.1,
      "en": "Sure.",
      "zh": "当然。"
    },
    {
      "id": 251,
      "start": 660.96,
      "end": 662.16,
      "en": "My name is Anna Farris.",
      "zh": "我的名字是安娜·法里斯。"
    },
    {
      "id": 252,
      "start": 662.16,
      "end": 662.68,
      "en": "Don't worry about it.",
      "zh": "别担心。"
    },
    {
      "id": 253,
      "start": 663.16,
      "end": 664.72,
      "en": "You say this to me all the time.",
      "zh": "你一直对我这么说。"
    },
    {
      "id": 254,
      "start": 664.72,
      "end": 665.84,
      "en": "I'm terrible with names too.",
      "zh": "我也特别记不住人名。"
    },
    {
      "id": 255,
      "start": 668.04,
      "end": 678.36,
      "en": "Well, I hope that you've all enjoyed our lesson for today, and remember to check out our website at EnglishPod.com.",
      "zh": "好吧，我希望你们今天都喜欢我们的课程，并记得查看我们的网站 englishpod.com。"
    },
    {
      "id": 256,
      "start": 678.36,
      "end": 683.12,
      "en": "Where you can find a lot of other resources and you can leave all your questions and comments.",
      "zh": "您可以在哪里找到许多其他资源，您可以留下所有问题和评论。"
    },
    {
      "id": 257,
      "start": 683.44,
      "end": 684.44,
      "en": "Yeah.",
      "zh": "对。"
    },
    {
      "id": 258,
      "start": 684.44,
      "end": 687.18,
      "en": "Marco and I are always on the site, so we're happy to answer all of your questions.",
      "zh": "Marco 和我总是在网站上，所以我们很乐意回答您的所有问题。"
    },
    {
      "id": 259,
      "start": 687.52,
      "end": 687.78,
      "en": "Exactly.",
      "zh": "正是这样。"
    },
    {
      "id": 260,
      "start": 688.08,
      "end": 690.42,
      "en": "So now it's time for us to say...",
      "zh": "所以现在是我们说的时候了..."
    },
    {
      "id": 261,
      "start": 690.52,
      "end": 690.64,
      "en": "Goodbye.",
      "zh": "再见。"
    },
    {
      "id": 262,
      "start": 691.52,
      "end": 695.52,
      "en": "Goodbye.",
      "zh": "再见。"
    }
